message: "If you use these materials, please cite both the article and this repository."
title: "Application of Nondental 3D Software in Dentistry: A Scoping Review - reproducibility materials"
abstract: >-
  Complete search strategies, prompts, analysis scripts, raw model responses, the
  two-stage full-text re-assessment pass, the locked analysis dataset (863 included
  studies), all derived statistics and the author-verification materials for a
  scoping review of nondental 3D software use across dental disciplines.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Qihang-He/nondental-3d-software-scoping-review"
keywords:
